* Native AD24.4 NSX probe: TBV1 had no effect; TCV applies breakdown temperature shift.
* NBV constrained by both datasheet rdif maxima and IR<=5e-08A at VR=30.1V; 5% guard. Local rdif<=150ohm at 0.002A, not an exact measured knee.
* SZ scenario: midpoint of datasheet range [37.6,46.6]mV/K at 0.002A. Not typical/measured; no tolerance sweep. TCV (MixedSim, V/K, BV(T)=BV-TCV*(T-25)) locally calibrated at 25C; linear extrapolation not a measured full-temperature curve.
* BZX84-C43 | Nexperia
* Source: Datasheets/Diodes/BZX84_Nexperia.pdf
* Revision: Rev. 7, 01-Jan-2023
* Datasheet-limit approximation at 25C. IS/N/RS fitted or assumed, not manufacturer model parameters. Single VF point: N assumed 2, RS=0. CJO converted from Cd using assumed VJ=1,M=0.5. TT omitted; trr is not TT. No validated switching, thermal or tolerance model. Nominal VZ and local rdif/SZ scenarios calibrated as detailed above; full knee/leakage not fitted.
* VF anchors (A,V): [[0.01, 0.9]]
